  "privacyDraft": "This policy is under review. The contact channel, retention periods and legal grounds must be defined before the final version is published.",
  "privacyResponsibleTitle": "Who is responsible",
  "privacyResponsibleBody": "Tech Mow is responsible for GlicNote. A privacy contact email will be added to this policy.",
  "privacyDataTitle": "Data we use",
  "privacyDataBody": "Google sign-in provides an identifier, name, email and profile photo URL. You may provide a username, an optional full date of birth and diabetes type, glucose readings, insulin, measurement moment and time, and an emergency contact. The server stores each reading’s time zone and local date. Health information is sensitive personal data. Provide third-party details, such as your emergency contact, with that person’s knowledge.",
  "privacyPurposeTitle": "Why we use data",
  "privacyPurposeBody": "We use data to identify your account, maintain your session, organize your history, calculate averages and your age and display your profile and emergency contact. The service does not access your Google password, Gmail or Drive. This app version includes no advertising or analytics tools.",
  "privacySessionTitle": "Session and profile photo",
  "privacySessionBody": "Your session is saved on your device so you do not need to sign in each time. Signing out removes the local session but keeps server data. Your photo loads from the URL supplied by Google; this request may send your IP address and technical information to the image server.",
  "privacySharingTitle": "Privacy and sharing",
  "privacySharingBody": "Your history and emergency contact are private. Readings are never published automatically. Planned social features let you share selected content with people approved to follow you; these screens are not yet available in this app version.",
  "privacyProvidersTitle": "Services and storage",
  "privacyProvidersBody": "Google provides authentication and the photo. Supabase hosts authentication and the database; the current project uses a region in the United States. Render hosts the GlicNote API. These services may process data in other countries according to their configuration and terms.",
  "privacyRetentionTitle": "Retention and security",
  "privacyRetentionBody": "We use authentication, API access controls and protected database connections. Readings remain on the server after closing the app or signing out. Tech Mow still needs to define and document retention periods, backup handling and deletion procedures. Absolute security cannot be guaranteed.",
  "privacyRightsTitle": "Your rights and requests",
  "privacyRightsBody": "You may request information about data use, access, correction and, where applicable, deletion, portability and withdrawal of consent. A contact channel will be listed here. This version has no in-app export or automatic account deletion; signing out does not delete your account or readings. Reading this policy or signing in with Google does not replace specific consent where required.",
  "privacyUpdatesTitle": "Updates",
  "privacyUpdatesBody": "This policy will change as GlicNote evolves. Changes to purposes, sharing, providers, retention or contact details must appear here and in the public version. GlicNote supports personal organization and does not replace professional healthcare.",
